      "created_at": "2018-10-17T05:19:56.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Dear experts, could you please explain me the following situation:</p>\n<p>At the end of Miss Informations turn she puts the top card of each hero deck on the bottom of that deck.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://ibb.co/m2m1mL\" data-bbcode=\"true\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"><img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/3/35af8c88aa67f9157d1c3afe047df5af8d0d198f.jpeg\" alt=\"\" data-base62-sha1=\"7EVpUczTVDBxC1XIcVUjUxUp2eb\" width=\"640\" height=\"480\"></a></p>\n<p>Why isn‘t she targeting Writhes deck at all?</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://ibb.co/ndtgmL\" data-bbcode=\"true\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"><img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/2/2cd58be1820d9f15b524724576437a9bb8686251.jpeg\" alt=\"\" data-base62-sha1=\"6oCwQrD2jZ92tF3JhZULgPH1OEh\" width=\"640\" height=\"480\"></a></p>\n<p>I put a shinobi assassin in top of his deck but it‘s still his deck which should be affected.&nbsp;</p>\n<br>\n[url=https://ibb.co/kgbdY0][img]https://preview.ibb.co/c5Mqff/B4-AAF969-2-BF1-4-F38-892-F-6-E327-A84030-A.png[/img][/url]\n<p>I couldn‘t find a phrasing on the shinobi card which should interrupt it.&nbsp;</p>\n<br>\n[url=https://ibb.co/hVGCt0][img]https://preview.ibb.co/hsgO0f/780-A3952-0-FB5-4-EBE-A7-B1-666-EF179-EFC7.png[/img][/url]\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
