      "raw": "Dear experts, could you please explain me the following situation:\n\nAt the end of Miss Informations turn she puts the top card of each hero deck on the bottom of that deck.\n\n[url=https://ibb.co/m2m1mL]![](upload://7EVpUczTVDBxC1XIcVUjUxUp2eb.jpeg)[/url]\n\nWhy isn‘t she targeting Writhes deck at all?\n\n[url=https://ibb.co/ndtgmL]![](upload://6oCwQrD2jZ92tF3JhZULgPH1OEh.jpeg)[/url]\n\nI put a shinobi assassin in top of his deck but it‘s still his deck which should be affected.&nbsp;\n\n<br />\n[url=https://ibb.co/kgbdY0][img]https://preview.ibb.co/c5Mqff/B4-AAF969-2-BF1-4-F38-892-F-6-E327-A84030-A.png[/img][/url]\n\nI couldn‘t find a phrasing on the shinobi card which should interrupt it.&nbsp;\n\n<br />\n[url=https://ibb.co/hVGCt0][img]https://preview.ibb.co/hsgO0f/780-A3952-0-FB5-4-EBE-A7-B1-666-EF179-EFC7.png[/img][/url]\n\n&nbsp;",
