      "created_at": "2018-10-17T10:46:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>The Shinobi Assassin is still a card on top of his deck, it should be moved and there is nothing on the Assassin that reacts to \"being moved\". There are several cards (coincidenatally) in Writhe's deck that will get the Assassin shuffled into his deck though!</p>",
